abstract: >-
  A zero-config, human-guided Agent Skill and scientific operating framework
  for rigorous reasoning, decision-oriented research, bounded execution,
  evidence-controlled interpretation, transparent project state, and
  reproducible research history across experimental, computational,
  theoretical, machine-learning, and hybrid research.
